WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.600
Goal: protect your files against loss or data hostage-taking (ransomware) and know where to turn in the United Kingdom, Spain and Colombia.

2
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:24.300
The 3-2-1 backup rule: 3 copies in total, on 2 different media and 1 disconnected or off-site (if you leave the USB drive always plugged in, ransomware encrypts it too).

3
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:38.400
Verified official channels: United Kingdom (NCSC / Action Fraud, and your bank on 159), Spain (INCIBE free helpline 017 and the police), Colombia (National Police Virtual CAI and the Attorney General's Office).

4
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:45.600
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
